        "en": [
          "Do you want to be like everyone else and go where everyone else goes?.... It's up to you...The Montalbert mountain guides office offers professional accompaniment for mountain activities with state-qualified high- and medium-altitude mountain guides and mountain bike guides."
        ],
        "it": [
          "Volete essere come tutti gli altri e andare dove vanno gli altri?... Dipende da voi?\nIl Bureau des Guides è: guide alpine professioniste, accompagnatori di montagna, istruttori di mountain bike."
        ],
